<rml>
<head><link type="text/rcss" href="hud.rcss" /></head>
<body>
  <div id="panel">
    <h1>Animated game UI</h1>
    <p>UI motion uses presentation time. Pause gameplay and watch it continue.</p>
    <p>Width and opacity keyframes</p>
    <div class="track"><div id="fill"></div></div>
    <p>Transform keyframes</p>
    <div class="track"><div id="marker"></div></div>
    <p id="state" data-class-paused="paused">Tick: {{tick}} | Paused: {{paused}}</p>
    <button id="pause" data-event-click="command('Pause')">Pause</button>
    <button id="resume" data-event-click="command('Resume')">Resume</button>
    <button id="step" data-event-click="command('Step')">Step</button>
    <p>Hover a button for a color transition. The pause state changes color smoothly.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</rml>
